          "System V 用 rcx，Windows x64 用 rdi"
        ],
        "correct": 0,
        "explain": "参数放哪个寄存器是调用约定（ABI）规定的，不是 CPU 规定的：System V psABI 的整数参数依次是 rdi、rsi、rdx、rcx、r8、r9；Microsoft x64 约定是 rcx、rdx、r8、r9。",
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "relation": "adapted",
            "source_id": "sysv-abi",
            "locator": "§3.2.3 Parameter Passing；Figure 3.4 Register Usage"
          },
          {
            "relation": "adapted",
