          },
          {
            "relation": "adapted",
            "source_id": "dis",
            "locator": "Ch.7 §7.1.1 Registers"
          }
        ],
        "difficulty": 2,
        "goal": "master"
      },
      {
        "stem": "一个返回 int 的函数，返回值放在哪个寄存器里？（System V 与 Windows x64 都适用）",
