          "rax（int 用它的低 32 位 eax）",
          "rdi",
          "rsp",
          "rip"
        ],
        "correct": 0,
        "explain": "System V psABI 的 Figure 3.4 把 rax 列为第一个返回值寄存器；Microsoft 文档说 64 位以内的标量返回值通过 RAX 返回。int 只占低 32 位，所以编译结果里用 eax。",
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "relation": "adapted",
            "source_id": "sysv-abi",
            "locator": "§3.2.3 Parameter Passing；Figure 3.4 Register Usage"
          },
          {
            "relation": "adapted",
            "source_id": "ms-x64-abi",
            "locator": "x64-calling-convention：Parameter passing；Return values"
          }
        ],
        "difficulty": 1,
        "goal": "master"
      },
      {
        "stem": "执行 mov al, bl（8 位写入）之后，rax 的高 56 位会怎样？",
        "choices": [
          "保持原来的值",
          "被清零",
          "被 bl 的符号位填充",
          "变成未定义的值"
